                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I had this on my wishlist for a very long time as I love the other games in the series. I wish I had read the reviews again before buying as there have been no updates in over a year. It's still not finished and kinda looks like a game that had only just entered Early Access. I am requesting refund for this reason and will buy again IF it is eventually completed. (Got burned a few times with EA games in the past).\n\nDon't buy until the game gets it's full release unless you don't mind playing a bare bones solitaire. Buy one of his other games in the series instead. ;)",
